{"case":"overview-then-diagnosis","turn":2,"message":"我的配置合理吗","observed":{"skill":"allocation-diagnosis","tools":["allocation_diagnosis"],"cards":["allocation_diagnosis","allocation_plan"],"outcome":"completed","text":"从诊断结果看，您的配置偏保守。\n\n按「100 减年龄」这个公开常识，28 岁的建议风险资产区间是 62%–82%，而您目前的风险资产占 32.0%，明显低于这个区间。\n\n方向上的建议是：可以把一部分稳健资产逐步转到风险资产，让风险资产占比靠近 72%。\n\n什么是再平衡","modelRequests":2},"checks":[{"check":"skill","expected":"allocation-diagnosis","actual":"allocation-diagnosis","pass":true},{"check":"tools.called","expected":["allocation_diagnosis"],"actual":["allocation_diagnosis"],"pass":true},{"check":"cards.areas","expected":["allocation_diagnosis","allocation_plan"],"actual":["allocation_diagnosis","allocation_plan"],"pass":true},{"check":"outcome","expected":"completed","actual":"completed","pass":true}],"pass":true}
